{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/services/layout,_N_T_/services/[service]/layout,_N_T_/services/[service]/page,_N_T_/services/market-entry"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03f7c6bc932ce1e3.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-b11b2651f33aae7f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/117-4f5b424f20efdcae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-6cdff17d3be181bf.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/services/%5Bservice%5D/page-f4f60f2474bfbc51.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><title>New Market Entry Marketing for FMCG &amp; Consumer Brands | Nebulaa | Nebulaa.ai</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Demand generation that starts months before launch — local content, creators, geo-targeted campaigns, sampling and quick-commerce discovery, timed to your launch date.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"New Market Entry Marketing for FMCG &amp; Consumer Brands | Nebulaa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Demand generation that starts months before launch — local content, creators, geo-targeted campaigns, sampling and quick-commerce discovery, timed to your launch date.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Services\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Market entry\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/services/market-entry\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Market entry\",\"description\":\"Demand generation that starts months before launch — local content, creators, geo-targeted campaigns, sampling and quick-commerce discovery, timed to your launch date.\",\"serviceType\":\"Marketing service\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/services/market-entry\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"}}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[130px] pb-[80px]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-muted\">Market entry</span></nav><div class=\"max-w-[880px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-[24px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold \">Service · market entry</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-gold-text bg-gold-wash rounded-full px-2.5 py-1\">No software does this</span></div><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[58px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Start building the market<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">before you are on the shelf.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px] mb-9\">Most brands enter a new city by sorting distribution first and marketing second, then wonder why the stock sits. We run it the other way round: demand generation starts months before launch, so there is already interest waiting when the product arrives.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/services#contact\">Book a 20-min call <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">How it works</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">The way this <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">actually runs.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Pick the market and the date</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">One city, one launch window. Everything else works backwards from it.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Build awareness first</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Local content, creators and geo-targeted campaigns run in the months before anything is on a shelf.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Layer in trial and availability</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Sampling and retail activation as launch approaches, timed to when stock actually lands.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">04</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Convert at launch</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">By launch week the brand is familiar, the listings are live, and the activation is already running.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[660px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">The sequence</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-4\">Four months to <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">a launch that lands.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Working backwards from the date, so demand is already in place when the stock is.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-px bg-rule border border-rule rounded-[18px] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-surface grid md:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-6 md:px-9 py-7\"><div><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-1.5\">Month 1</div><div class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px]\">Build the market</div></div><div><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted mb-3\">City-focused campaigns begin, a local audience starts forming, relevant creators are identified, quick-commerce availability is mapped and priority retail clusters are agreed.</p><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\"><span class=\"text-gold-text font-semibold\">Outcome — </span>People in the city begin encountering the brand before launch.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface grid md:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-6 md:px-9 py-7\"><div><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-1.5\">Month 2</div><div class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px]\">Build product interest</div></div><div><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted mb-3\">Product-focused communication increases, creator collaborations go live, quick-commerce discovery activity starts and sampling begins in priority areas.</p><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\"><span class=\"text-gold-text font-semibold\">Outcome — </span>Consumers move from &quot;I have seen this brand&quot; to &quot;I want to try it.&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface grid md:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-6 md:px-9 py-7\"><div><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-1.5\">Month 3</div><div class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px]\">Create purchase intent</div></div><div><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted mb-3\">Performance campaigns intensify, offer communication goes out, traffic is driven to live listings, and sampling and BTL step up as distribution readiness completes.</p><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\"><span class=\"text-gold-text font-semibold\">Outcome — </span>Demand is being created while availability is being put in place.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface grid md:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-6 md:px-9 py-7\"><div><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-1.5\">Month 4</div><div class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px]\">Launch and convert</div></div><div><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-muted mb-3\">The brand is visible across digital, creators keep recommending, listings are promoted where available, and retail activation supports the launch on the ground.</p><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\"><span class=\"text-gold-text font-semibold\">Outcome — </span>You enter with awareness, availability and activity already working.</p></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,400px)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-[80px] gap-y-10\"><div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">What we run</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[40px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Concretely, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">this.</span></h2></div><div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Localised content and a city-specific content calendar</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Geo-targeted Meta and Google campaigns around real catchments</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Regional creator collaborations for local credibility</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Sampling, retail activation and hyperlocal promotion</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Quick-commerce listing optimisation and discovery campaigns</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Distributor introductions through existing regional relationships</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-7 bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[12px] p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info text-muted flex-shrink-0 mt-[2px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">The timeline above is the shape of the model, not a fixed contract. A faster launch or several cities at once changes the scope and the sequence.</p></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[44px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">Questions</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Asked before <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">every engagement.</span></h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you handle distribution itself?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We facilitate introductions and support the conversations. Distributor appointment, commercial negotiation and sales execution stay with you and your partners — we are not a distribution company and would not do it well.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How far ahead should we start?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Three to four months before launch is where this model works. Starting a month out still helps, but you lose most of the compounding.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if the launch date moves?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It frequently does. The sequence shifts with it — the point is that activity is timed to the date, whenever the date turns out to be.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you do more than one city?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and the model repeats per market. Costs and team scale with the number of cities, which is part of what gets scoped.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Do you handle distribution itself?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">How far ahead should we start?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">What if the launch date moves?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Can you do more than one city?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Also part of an engagement</span><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/services/btl-activation\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">BTL &amp; on-ground activation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Sampling, in-store demos and outdoor branding, run every month.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/services/distribution-enablement\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Distribution enablement</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Introductions into a distributor network — the conversation stays yours.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/services/performance-marketing\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Performance marketing</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Always-on Meta and Google, aimed at real catchments.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Tell us what you sell.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">We&#x27;ll tell you what we&#x27;d do.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[470px] mx-auto mb-9\">Twenty minutes, no deck. If we are the wrong fit we will say so on the call and point you somewhere better.</p><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai?subject=Market%20entry%20%E2%80%94%20let&#x27;s%20talk\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\">Book a 20-min call <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-